Cerulean_Text_Haircut1::
  .string "Hi, I can groom one of your\n"
  .string "Pokémon.\l"
  .string "For only \$500!\p"
  .string "Does that sound good?$"


Cerulean_Text_Haircut2::
  .string "Great! Who shall I groom?$"


Cerulean_Text_Haircut3 ::
  .string "Alright, let's get {STR_VAR_1}\n"
  .string "looking nice and spiffy.$"


Cerulean_Text_Haircut4::
  .string "I'm done grooming for today.\p"
  .string "Come back tomorrow though!$"


Cerulean_Text_Haircut5::
  .string "There you go!\p"
  .string "{STR_VAR_1} seems pleased.\p"
  .string "As for the payment...$"


Cerulean_Text_Haircut6::
  .string "Thank you!\p"
  .string "Please, come back tomorrow!$"


Cerulean_Text_Haircut7::
  .string "That's not enough money...$"


